# Cloudflare Workers static-asset headers (served before the Worker).

# Per-page markdown for agents (scripts/build-content.ts -> public/md/**; middleware.ts redirects an
# `Accept: text/markdown` request for a post or guide here). The Content-Type is the load-bearing line: it is what the
# client receives. Not content-hashed, so a short max-age.
/md/*
  Content-Type: text/markdown; charset=utf-8
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *

# The whole published site as one text file. The charset matters: it holds Devanagari, which is mojibake in a client
# that falls back to latin-1.
/llms-full.txt
  Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
